2026-09-24T04:12:17.0557195Z After setup, use your coding agent normally; run `dw status` after a change.
2026-09-24T04:12:17.0557744Z 
2026-09-24T04:12:17.0557899Z Useful when needed:
2026-09-24T04:12:17.0558600Z   dw explain                         Explain the latest change from local evidence, with no AI required
